    "status": "present",
    "value": "Build a dictionary object from a list of lowercase words. It must answer queries that give a prefix and a suffix: return the position (index in the original list) of a word that starts with the prefix and ends with the suffix. If several words qualify, return the largest index; if none does, return -1. The object is constructed once and then queried many times."
  },
